                        "fulfill_request"
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "Notifies Chariot that a new PO box has been provisioned by the lockbox provider.\n\nThe `request_id` is a one-time unique value generated by Chariot for each PO box request.\n\nSee the [Provisioning guide](/v2026-01-15/guides/lockbox-providers/provisioning) for the full provisioning flow."
